  "[action] goes to see father",
  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung): \"I do not wish to be a poor man and a fool. I do not wish to be a poor man and a fool.\"",
  "[action] (to the eldest son) Wang Lung stares at his eldest son, bewildered.",
  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung): \"I will not be a poor man and a fool. I will be a rich man and a noble man.\"",
  "[silence] (to the eldest son) Wang Lung says nothing.",
  "[action] (to the eldest son) goes to see second son",
  "[action] (to the second son) Wang Lung sits and listens to his second son's plans.",
  "the second son (to Wang Lung): \"The railroad is to be completed next year. I have heard that it will be completed before this time next year. Then the land of the Old Lord will not be worth half of what it is now, because the land will be so near the sea and the railway station. We may sell it all.\"",
  "Wang Lung (to the second son): \"Well, and I have that land!\"",
  "[action] (to Wang Lung) eldest son looks at second son",
  "[action] (to Wang Lung) goes to father",
